            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whether an exemption applies to you is best checked in advance with the responsible mission abroad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tool_a1_test_exemptions_examples": {
      "comment": "A1 German test booking guide (P6-F2).",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel: Ehepartner von EU-Bürgern oder von bestimmten Fachkräften bzw. Blaue-Karte-Inhabern, ein erkennbar geringer Integrationsbedarf, eine nachweisbare Härte oder Staatsangehörige bestimmter Länder."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: spouses of EU citizens or of certain skilled workers or EU Blue Card holders, an obviously low integration need, a recognisable hardship, or citizens of certain countries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tool_a1_test_exemptions_heading": {
